SSCD, "A Self-Supervised Descriptor for Image Copy Detection": the sscd_disc_mixup model
https://github.com/facebookresearch/sscd-copy-detection

Heat's vision service runs this model's weights, exported to ONNX, and keeps a copy of the published TorchScript file
for its builds. The whole project, its model weights included, is under the MIT license below: the repository's LICENSE
since its commit 6db4262 of 2022-07-14, and its author's answer about the weights of 2023-09-26
(https://github.com/facebookresearch/sscd-copy-detection/issues/12).

